SUMMARY:Upstream Rebellion
DESCRIPTION:\nUpstream Rebellion was born in the hills of Western North Car
 olina\, where front porch jams and festival fields raised them. A group of
  friends and musicians who found each other through a shared love of blueg
 rass — not just as a genre\, but as a way of life.\n\n\n\nFrom late-nigh
 t college pickin’ sessions to backroad barn gigs\, their music has alway
 s been tied to community\, storytelling\, and the raw energy of live perfo
 rmance.\n\n\n\nJoin them right here at Jack of the Wood! Music 8:30-11:30p
 m\, $10 cover at the door.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?
 v=lOsbHb2FcqQ\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 5/09/upstream1.webp
END:VEVENT
