SUMMARY:Vaden Landers
DESCRIPTION:\nVaden Landers is a multi-instumentalist &amp\; singer-songwri
 ter hailing from eastern Tennessee who blends influences from honky tonk\,
  hillbilly\, folk\, blues\, ragtime\, jazz\, western swing and old-time Ap
 palachian to bring new fire to a classic sound!\n\n\n\nAs a teen\, he set 
 out traveling the American highways &amp\; railways\, learning the ways of
  a traveler-musician while honing his songwriting\, singing\, yodeling &am
 p\; picking skills busking &amp\; touring from Alaska to Florida.\n\n\n\nL
 anders' original songs harken back to the golden days of country music and
 \, with a voice that draws comparison to Hank Sr.\, he continues to turn h
 eads as an exciting new player in the revival of the traditional country m
 usic scene.\n\n\n\nMusic from 8:30-11:30\, $10 cover at the door.\n\n\n\n\
 nhttps://youtu.be/68PseNvFS3Y?si=DOwPPSdsdQvGAa4i\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu
 .be/jfUrGbxlka0\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/UOcH0nRoQ9c\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps:/
 /youtu.be/8sDqM4b4Njg?si=BC9f5qfnfDEIQjx4\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 3/11/VadenLanders_overalls.jpg
END:VEVENT
