SUMMARY:Warren Haynes Presents: Christmas Jam by Day 2026
DESCRIPTION:\nWarren Haynes Presents: The Christmas Jam by Day returns to J
 ack of the Wood Pub Saturday\, December 12th!\n\n\n\nThe pub will open ear
 ly to get you in the spirit before our lineup of singer-songwriters perfor
 m in the round throughout the afternoon!\n\n\n\nFull details will be annou
 nced soon!\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/10/XMAS-JAM_2026_IG_1080x1440_SaveTheDate.jpg
